<title>USA: Star Banc Q3 net diluted shr rises.</title>
<headline>Star Banc Q3 net diluted shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>STAR BANC CORPORATION AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>	   (dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						  Third Quarter</p>
<p>						1996	1995</p>
<p>Earnings:</p>
<p> Net income			  $  38,217  $  34,197</p>
<p>Per share:</p>
<p> Fully diluted earnings		 1.30	 1.14</p>
<p> Common dividends declared	    0.47	 0.40</p>
<p> Preferred dividends declared	   --	 1.50</p>
<p>Average balances:</p>
<p> Total assets			9,667,317   9,507,859</p>
<p> Earning assets		    8,833,357   8,638,367</p>
<p>Loans, net of unearned</p>
<p>   interest			  7,331,866   6,793,289</p>
<p> Deposits			    7,634,497   7,482,081</p>
<p> Total shareholders' equity	837,283   788,224</p>
<p>At quarter end:</p>
<p>Common shares issued and</p>
<p>   outstanding		    29,136,171   29,845,712</p>
<p>Excluding FDIC assessment:</p>
<p> Net income			     41,467	  34,197</p>
<p> Noninterest expense		  76,822	  70,374</p>
<p>Fully diluted earnings</p>
<p>   per share				1.41	    1.14</p>
<p> Return on average assets	   1.71 %	    1.43 %</p>
<p> Return on average equity	    19.70	   17.21</p>
<p>Noninterest expense to net</p>
<p>   revenue				 50.22	   54.22</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 net both periods includes a one-time, pre-tax assessment of $5 million, or $0.11 per fully diluted share, to replenish the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
